#: operators/convert.py:29
msgid "Create a object for each Keymesh block and animate their visibility with\nthe chosen conversation method to faithfully recreate the Keymesh animation.\nThe result can be used in render farms, or to play the animation without the add-on."
msgstr "为每个 Keymesh 块创建一个物体，并使用所选转换方法为其可见性制作动画，以忠实复现 Keymesh 动画。\n结果可用于渲染农场，或在没有该插件的情况下播放动画。"

